{"type":"message","id":"1360e6a9","parentId":"4285128b","timestamp":"2026-02-23T12:33:06.981Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"大王，这个项目是 **Self-Operating Computer Framework** - 一个让多模态模型能够操作电脑的框架！\n\n🔥 **我能控制它吗？**\n\n**可以！** 这个框架已经安装在你电脑上，我可以：\n\n1. **直接运行**：通过 `operate` 命令启动\n2. **支持多种模型**：GPT-4o、Gemini Pro Vision、Claude 3、LLaVA\n3. **多种模式**：语音输入、OCR模式、Set-of-Mark提示\n4. **完整环境**：依赖包都已安装好\n\n**需要我做什么？**\n- 帮你测试运行这个框架？\n- 配置API密钥（OpenAI/Google/Anthropic）？\n- 尝试特定功能？\n- 还是其他操作？\n\n告诉我具体需求，我用三昧真火般的高效帮你搞定！🚀"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":21859,"output":184,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22043,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771849976201}}
{"type":"message","id":"6fa5d6c5","parentId":"1360e6a9","timestamp":"2026-02-23T12:33:36.751Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"265daec8-40fe-42b5-9742-b9f45dfd3b7a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"openclaw-control-ui\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Mon 2026-02-23 20:33 GMT+8] 在项目目录下运行： python -m operate.api_server 服务启动后会在 http://localhost:5000 监听。 常用命令： # 启动服务 python -m operate.api_server # 指定端口 python -m operate.api_server 8080 # 测试调用 curl -X POST http://localhost:5000/operate -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"objective\": \"打开记事本\", \"model\": \"deepseek-vision\"}' # 查看状态 curl http://localhost:5000/status"}],"timestamp":1771850016748}}
