{"type":"message","id":"8a6cf4d6","parentId":"87f05eec","timestamp":"2026-02-23T13:34:24.935Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🔥 **好的大王！我来详细说明创建虚拟环境的完整步骤：**\n\n## 🚀 **完整创建步骤**\n\n### **步骤1：创建虚拟环境**\n```bash\npython -m venv soc_env\n```\n\n### **步骤2：激活虚拟环境**\n```bash\n# PowerShell\nsoc_env\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n\n# 或者 CMD\nsoc_env\\Scripts\\activate.bat\n```\n\n### **步骤3：安装核心依赖（使用国内镜像加速）**\n```bash\npip install -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple openai anthropic google-generativeai torch torchvision\n```\n\n### **步骤4：安装其他必要包**\n```bash\npip install -i https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple easyocr flask requests numpy pillow\n```\n\n### **步骤5：验证安装**\n```bash\npython -c \"import openai, torch, easyocr; print('所有依赖安装成功!')\"\n```\n\n### **步骤6：启动API服务器**\n```bash\npython -m operate.api_server\n```\n\n## 📋 **检查清单**\n- [ ] 虚拟环境创建完成\n- [ ] 核心依赖安装完成  \n- [ ] 所有包无冲突\n- [ ] API服务器可正常启动\n\n## ⚡ **我的建议**\n先完成**步骤1-2**创建环境，然后我可以帮您继续后面的步骤。这样最稳妥！\n\n**大王您完成了哪一步？我随时待命继续！** 🔥"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":42282,"output":325,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771853598215}}
