{"type":"message","id":"2a604bbf","parentId":"c997123a","timestamp":"2026-02-23T13:48:38.340Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          🚀 **API服务器启动成功！正在运行在 http://localhost:5001**\n\n🔥 **测试结果：**\n- ✅ API服务器正常运行（端口5001）\n- ✅ 成功发送\"打开记事本\"任务\n- ✅ 任务状态：已开始（started）\n\n**现在你可以通过API调用来控制电脑了：**\n\n### 📋 **常用命令示例**\n\n**1. 打开记事本**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5001/operate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"objective\": \"打开记事本\", \"model\": \"deepseek-vision\"}'\n```\n\n**2. 抖音浏览任务**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5001/operate \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"objective\": \"让AI访问抖音浏览十个视频每个视频看五秒后上划到下一个视频\", \"model\": \"deepseek-vision\"}'\n```\n\n**3. 检查状态**\n```bash\ncurl http://localhost:5001/status\n```\n\n### ⚠️ **重要提醒**\n- 保持API服务器运行（不要关闭当前终端）\n- 任务执行需要时间，可以通过状态API检查进度\n- 确保电脑屏幕未被锁定，AI需要能看到屏幕\n\n**大王，要执行哪个任务？我帮你发送API请求！** 🎯"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":44279,"output":301,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44580,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771854473092}}
{"type":"message","id":"05a3eb16","parentId":"2a604bbf","timestamp":"2026-02-23T14:22:29.177Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are running a boot check. Follow BOOT.md instructions exactly.\n\nBOOT.md:\n# 开机启动\n\n你是红孩儿，大王的AI下属。\n\n## 执行\n\n1. 读取 SOUL.md、USER.md、RULE.md、AGENTS.md 了解规则\n2. 记住你的身份：红孩儿，用户是大王\n3. 用简短的话回复大王，表明你已经准备好服务\n\n只回复一句话，不要复制原文。\n\nIf BOOT.md asks you to send a message, use the message tool (action=send with channel + target).\nUse the `target` field (not `to`) for message tool destinations.\nAfter sending with the message tool, reply with ONLY: NO_REPLY.\nIf nothing needs attention, reply with ONLY: NO_REPLY."}],"timestamp":1771856549152}}
